&lt;p class=&quot;sc-gEkIjz cjtSrT MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 sc-hoLEA&quot;&gt;Raisin currently employs more than 800 people from over 75 countries worldwide. Today, the platform holds over 80 billion euros in assets from&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;more than one million investors&lt;/strong&gt; which have accrued over 5 billion euros in returns.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join our team of Relationship Managers and become part of an impactful and dynamic environment. Our team plays a central role at Raisin, responsible for fostering partnerships with our platforms’ partner banks.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Partnership Manager, you&#39;ll play a crucial role in driving Raisin&#39;s growth across Europe and the UK. Your primary mission is to cultivate and oversee daily interactions with Raisin&#39;s partner banks, and to lead or support managing key accounts. Beyond that, you&#39;ll spearhead the launch of new products,&amp;nbsp; integration of new banks into Raisin&#39;s and our B2B partners&#39; marketplaces, and improving their technical integration with us to ensure scalability and the growth of the banks’ assets under management and ultimately the Raisin platform.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
